{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869", "id": 501386248, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWU1MDEzODYyNDg=", "number": 869, "title": "Velocity issue with set_velocity_body() function", "user": {"login": "shrit", "id": 15039782, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDM5Nzgy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15039782?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit", "html_url": "https://github.com/shrit", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977272, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/question", "name": "question", "color": "cc317c", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 3, "created_at": "2019-10-02T09:45:45Z", "updated_at": "2019-10-07T07:53:07Z", "closed_at": "2019-10-02T14:53:19Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nI am using iris quadcopter in a SITL simulation. I am asking a quadcopter to move forward for 2 seconds at 1m/s. In this case I expect the quadcopter to move 2 meters. However, when calculating the traveled distance between the starting and the end positions, I have noticed that the quadcopter moves only for around 1.3 meters instead of 2 meters. This is the case for all actions executed on x and y plane (Forward, backward, left, right). However if I ask the quadcopter to move Up or Down (z axis) it will move correctly for 2 meters. \r\n\r\nDo anyone have an idea about what is happening?? Did I not understood the SDK correctly or this issue is related to PX4?\r\n\r\nBest regards,", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/537531142", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869#issuecomment-537531142", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869", "id": 537531142, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNzUzMTE0Mg==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-10-02T14:53:19Z", "updated_at": "2019-10-02T14:53:19Z", "body": "This behavior is expected because a quadcopter does not have infinite acceleration. You need to get up to the required speed first.\r\n\r\nIf you want to move 2 meters forward either use [position offboard control](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/7cd87db701d3ddd2cda1dfcca4b777991138125a/src/plugins/offboard/include/plugins/offboard/offboard.h#L208-L213) or write your own cascaded controller around the velocity controller which closes the loop around a position and outputs a velocity setpoint.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/537531142/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/537601213", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869#issuecomment-537601213", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/869", "id": 537601213, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNzYwMTIxMw==", "user": {"login": "shrit", "id": 15039782, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDM5Nzgy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15039782?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit", "html_url": "https://github.com/shrit", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/shrit/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-10-02T17:37:06Z", "updated_at": "2019-10-02T17:37:06Z", "body": "@julianoes, Thank you for your answer, that is very helpful.\r\n\r\nThe second option of writing a cascaded controlle